# Keep the build context minimal and free of secrets.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.vite
.git
.github
docs
**/*.md
**/.env
**/.env.*
.secrets.local.json
**/test
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
scripts/__fixtures__
# The extension is never part of the API image; only its package.json is needed so the workspace
# lockfile resolves.
apps/extension/*
!apps/extension/package.json
